 "remarks": "Spacious 2 bedroom, 2 full bathroom corner unit with views of the Five Mile River. The unit is located in the sought after Mallards Landing West Norwalk. It is close to Darien, Rowayton train station, I-95, shopping and restaurants. Large eat-in Kitchen (new appliances 2024) opens to the Dining room. Ensuite Master Bedroom with large closet. Hallway bathroom is conveniently located across from the 2nd bedroom. Dining and Living Rooms with double sliders to a huge deck. Enjoy this unit's privacy from its deck overlooking an ample backyard and the river. Major renovations done: new windows, new door, new exterior. Washer and dryer in the unit. 2 reserved parking spaces(number 30 & 40) right in front of the unit. Pool in the complex. Note - tenants work from home - some pics are virtually staged and some pics are from previous listing. No Pets.",
